{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"IvorConnect","modules":[{"name":"IvorConnect"}],"role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","color":{"standardColorIdentifier":"blue"},"roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"IvorConnect"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/UsingIvorConnect"],"title":"Guides"},{"anchor":"Outputs","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIOutput","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDIDestinationOutput","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDISourceOutput","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput"],"title":"Outputs"},{"anchor":"Routing","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIRouter","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIOutputChoice"],"title":"Routing"},{"anchor":"Playback","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIScheduler","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDISequence","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDISequencePlayer"],"title":"Playback"},{"anchor":"CoreMIDI","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDIClient","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDIDestination"],"title":"CoreMIDI"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"MIDI playback through CoreMIDI and Apple’s built-in General MIDI synth.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorconnect"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The IvorConnect framework sends "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/eBardX\/IvorMIDI","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"channel messages, each timestamped for the moment it should sound, to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"CoreMIDI and to Apple’s multitimbral MIDI synth. Every destination is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIOutput","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDISourceOutput","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" publishes a virtual source that other apps can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connect to."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDIDestinationOutput","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" sends to one CoreMIDI destination (a synth,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an interface, another app), and finds it again whenever it comes back."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" plays on AUMIDISynth with a General MIDI sound bank,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"placing every message at its exact sample."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIRouter","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" delivers each message to its channel’s outputs, keeping"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timestamps in order across all of them, so that a note-off sent “now” can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"never overtake a note-on already scheduled. A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDIClient","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"available destinations and reports every change to the MIDI setup."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import IvorConnect","import IvorMIDI","","let client = try CoreMIDIClient(name: \"MyApp\")","let source = try CoreMIDISourceOutput(client: client)","let synth = try SynthOutput(soundBankURL: SynthOutput.systemSoundBankURL)   \/\/ macOS","let router = MIDIRouter(outputs: [source, synth])","let start = ContinuousClock.now.advanced(by: .milliseconds(50))","","router.send(message: .noteOn(1, 60, 100), at: start)","router.send(message: .noteOff(1, 60, 0), at: start.advanced(by: .seconds(1)))","router.waitUntilDelivered()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/UsingIvorConnect","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a full guide to the outputs, routing, timing,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence playback, and platform notes."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://IvorConnect/documentation/IvorConnect/SynthOutput":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SynthOutput","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput","url":"\/documentation\/ivorconnect\/synthoutput","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SynthOutput"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MIDI output that plays on Apple’s multitimbral MIDI synth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(AUMIDISynth), loaded with a General MIDI sound bank, so that music can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be heard with no other software."}],"title":"SynthOutput"},"doc://IvorConnect/documentation/IvorConnect/UsingIv